23:46:40:639 [ 1584] | INFO  | [MGPU Bridge] [MGPU][R89] FINAL COUNTERS at 6000 consumed frames. | DEPTH mode=1 valid=6000 invalid=0 bound=5943 skipped=0 mismatches=0 disagreements=0 | MVEC mode=3 copies=5976 missing=25 lock-skipped=0 size-rejected=0 bound=5935 skipped=8 mismatches=0 disagreements=0 | ALIGNMENT 1=5900 2=38 3+=5 worst=7. EVERY MISMATCH AND EVERY DISAGREEMENT SHOULD BE 0; lock-skipped above a handful means the consumer is holding its mutex too long; ALIGNMENT well below 100% at 1 means GPU 1 is not keeping up with the frame interval, which is a throughput fact and not a vsync bug.
